      "sourceTextSha256": "ef7dd13d4254592cebff02f9bf9a613dc996d4d0f8ad99542d71a3dffba8f6bb",
      "text": "Bank fees: incoming transfer fees or a 5% credit card payment fee\n\nIf necessary, Ada Tours may replace the specified hotels with other hotels of the same category.\n\nIf necessary, Ada Tours may change the order of excursions while retaining the tour programme.\n\nAda Tours is not responsible for missed hotel breakfasts when you check out early for a flight or excursion.",
