      "sourceTextSha256": "4c28c4f74683cf698ede993f5b8e9bc9f4b4e97d9df8a7ea73ca44e491a3bbb4",
      "text": "Day 1 · Meeting at the airport and transfer to your hotel in Santiago. After check-in, enjoy a half-day city tour of Santiago. The sightseeing tour begins with a visit to the city's historic center. You will see Plaza de Armas, the Central Post Office, the Municipality, the Government Palace “La Moneda,” and Santa Lucía Hill. The tour then continues to the eastern part of the city, known for its modern residential neighborhoods and newly developed commercial districts.",
